    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "I will admit, the ape is not to my tastes. He is brash, boorish and a poor tactician. His insistence in appearing behind a video screen is tiresome - he forgets I know all his little secrets.",
    "value": "我得承认，这只猿猴不合我的胃口。他傲慢、粗俗，还是个蹩脚的战术家。他非要隔着视频屏幕现身，这做派令人厌烦 - 他忘了，他那些小秘密我可都一清二楚。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "And yet, he's an invaluable ally. I may not agree with his methods, but his goals are sound. And he has the ear of the self-styled lord, Thornwing. Strange times make for strange bedfellows. It's not like anything is conventional these days.",
    "value": "然而，他却是位不可或缺的盟友。我或许不认同他的手段，但他的目标无可指摘。况且，他还能在自封的领主荆棘之翼跟前说得上话。非常时期，总有奇怪的结盟。这年头，本来也没什么循规蹈矩的事了。"
